{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bababing-una-highchair-2604-0210","content_id":"7d8acba3-b6e7-4ada-9fb6-3bf3e33df268","description":"Product Safety Report for Bababing UNA Highchair presenting a risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"3e4a2eda-1963-421c-a44d-4e11d28fb6ad","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-01T10:50:47+01:00","id":"3e4a2eda-1963-421c-a44d-4e11d28fb6ad","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-01T10:50:47+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69f4777795de5140ec7eef93/2604-0210-product-safety-report-UNA-highchair.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Bababing UNA Highchair</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The affected highchairs present a risk of injuries as the four screws holding the seat unit to the base module may become loose leading to the seat becoming detached.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Bababing have launched a modification programme where consumers who own an affected highchair will be sent a free repair kit.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby Highchair</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Bababing</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product code</td>\n      <td>BB186-001</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch code</td>\n      <td>BQ00249 (located on the seat pad care label under the wording starting with BQ)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product sold from</td>\n      <td>26th October 2023</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Baby highchair with four wooden legs.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_3e4a2eda-1963-421c-a44d-4e11d28fb6ad\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69f4777795de5140ec7eef93/2604-0210-product-safety-report-UNA-highchair.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The affected highchairs present a risk of injuries as the four screws holding the seat unit to the base module may become loose leading to the seat becoming detached. If the seat detaches whilst in use the child could fall from a height and receive injuries.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Bababing have launched a modification programme where consumers who own an affected highchair will be sent a free repair kit. Not all chairs in batch BQ00249 are affected.</p>\n\n<p>Owners of an UNA highchair are advised to check their batch number and contact the Bababing customer service department on 01535 606871 or info@bababing.com</p>\n\n<p>For further details, please access the Bababing notice here: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://bababing.com/pages/product-recall-safety-notice\">https://bababing.com/pages/product-recall-safety-notice.</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2604-0210</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-01T09:51:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-01","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-01T10:51:56+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bababing-una-highchair-2604-0210","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bababing-una-highchair-2604-0210","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bababing-una-highchair-2604-0210","content_id":"7d8acba3-b6e7-4ada-9fb6-3bf3e33df268","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-01T09:51:56Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Bababing UNA Highchair (2604-0210)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bababing-una-highchair-2604-0210","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_re